    {
      "body": {
        "questions": [
          {
            "blocks": true,
            "pending_answer": null,
            "text": "Round half up, or to even like the ledger?"
          },
          {
            "blocks": true,
            "pending_answer": "No, only new ones.",
            "text": "Should old refunds be recomputed?"
          },
          {
            "blocks": false,
            "pending_answer": null,
            "text": "Show the rounding on the receipt?"
          }
        ],
        "questions_key": "questions",
        "sections": [
          {
            "heading": "Background",
            "key": "background",
            "required": true,
            "text": "Refunds are rounded per line, invoices on the total, so a refund can differ from its invoice by a cent."
          },
          {
            "heading": "Goal",
            "key": "goal",
            "required": true,
            "text": "A refund of a whole invoice returns exactly what the invoice charged.\nPartial refunds keep rounding per line."
          },
          {
            "heading": "What we know",
            "key": "what-we-know",
            "required": false,
            "text": "- Invoices round the total since 2.12.\n- `Refund#amount` sums rounded lines."
          },
          {
            "heading": "Open questions",
            "key": "questions",
            "required": false,
            "text": ""
          },
          {
